<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LEGO Galerija - Grid</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #333;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #ffcf00;
            height: 50px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #333;
            padding: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffcf00;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .container {
            width: 80%;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        p {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 2px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card span {
            display: block;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .card[data-set="city"] { border-color: #0055BF; }
        .card[data-set="technic"] { border-color: #F57C00; }
        .card[data-set="friends"] { border-color: #E91E63; }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header></header>
    
    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Početna</a>
        <a href="o-nama.html">O nama</a>
        <a href="galerija.html">Galerija</a>
        <a href="kontakt.html">Kontakt</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Galerija LEGO setova</h1>
        <p>Ovdje možete vidjeti nekoliko LEGO setova iz naše kolekcije.</p>

        <div class="gallery">
            <div class="card" data-set="city">
                <img src="city1.jpg" alt="City">
                <span>LEGO City policijska postaja</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card" data-set="technic">
                <img src="technic1.jpg" alt="Technic">
                <span>LEGO Technic trkaći auto</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card" data-set="friends">
                <img src="friends1.jpg" alt="Friends">
                <span>LEGO Friends kafić</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card" data-set="city">
                <img src="city2.jpg" alt="City">
                <span>LEGO City gradilište</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card" data-set="technic">
                <img src="technic2.jpg" alt="Technic">
                <span>LEGO Technic helikopter</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card" data-set="friends">
                <img src="friends2.jpg" alt="Friends">
                <span>LEGO Friends kućica na drvetu</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
